---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy · Nrvana AI">
  <section class="section pt-20 pb-20 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink-mute);">Effective June 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">The short version</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with anyone. We do not use tracking cookies. We do not retain your work or conversations beyond the scope of your project. You own everything you share with us.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">When you contact us or book a call, we receive your name and email address. If you become a client, we may receive additional context about your work: documents, workflows, preferences. We collect only what we need to do good work for you.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">This website uses a privacy-friendly analytics tool that counts page visits without fingerprinting users or setting tracking cookies. We see aggregate numbers only.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Contact information is used to reply to you and manage your project. Nothing else. We do not use your email for marketing unless you have explicitly asked for it. We do not add you to lists.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Work and context you share with us during an engagement is used solely to deliver that engagement. It is not used to train AI models, shared with third parties, or retained beyond what is reasonably necessary.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Third-party tools</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use a small number of third-party tools to run our business: a scheduling tool for booking calls, and standard email. These tools have their own privacy policies. If you book a call through our scheduling link, you are interacting with that provider's service.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">We do not use advertising platforms, social tracking pixels, or data brokers in any form.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">You can ask us at any time what information we hold about you, request that we correct it, or ask us to delete it. We will respond within seven days. Email <a href="mailto:hi@nrvana.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">hi@nrvana.com</a> with the subject line "Privacy request."</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If we make material changes to this policy, we will update the effective date above. We will not apply changes retroactively to information collected under a prior version.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Write to us at <a href="mailto:hi@nrvana.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">hi@nrvana.com</a>. We answer personally.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
